      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Filling cracks with (Zr,Hf)O2 gives the silicide layer a self-healing mechanism.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Silicon diffusion increases the depth of the protective coating.",
