      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed self-healing and coating-depth mechanisms improve wear resistance relative to an otherwise identical unmodified high-entropy-alloy coating.",
